(dsv41/, glm5/, exl3/, tensor/), copied by scripts/sync-sushi.sh from commit 17b2ac699ae7406b49c3fff9f85a976081e6aa9c.
The files src/sushi/{model,transformer,status,scheduler,test_models,tokenizer,dflash,model_load,transient_peak,
cooler_side,bills,gpu_mem,metal,pipeline_manifest,model_settings,mlx_util,trunk,prefill_plan,mtp_plan,sampler,
test_note,chat,forward_refusal,request_media,server_state,test_support}.zig, src/sushi/dsv41/{repack,dsv41_state,
pair_major_pack_test}.zig, src/sushi/tensor/{route,matmul,attention,core}.zig, and src/sushi/arch/*.zig there are this
repo's own cut edges. It is built against the mlx-serve plugin kit.
The sync then applies this repo's edits to the copy: patches/*.patch.
